# Scoped un-ignore for canonical source-of-truth files under code/.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore excludes *.json globally (those are normally large
# data artefacts). focal_species.json is SOURCE, not data: it is the single
# source of truth for the 41 focal species and every analysis reads it, so the
# repo is broken without it.
#
# This file is scoped to code/ and changes nothing elsewhere. The root
# .gitignore is deliberately left untouched.
!focal_species.json
